    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n82417" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περίτροχ-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>circular</i>, of a star in a
			horse's forehead, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. ἠΰτε μήνη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					23.455
				</span></i>
			 ; of the sun or moon, <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				3.1229
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Tryph.
				518
			</span></i> ; of a hat, <i><span class="en">
				Call.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				124
			</span></i> ; of a <i>round</i> lake, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. ὕδασι λίμνη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.P.
					987
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> neut.pl.as
				Adv., 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περιτρόχαλα, περίτροχα
					κείρεσθαι</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				Agath.
				1.3
			</span></i>.</div>
